  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry name="Battle Traits: Khazalite Holds" id="4113-3014-e400-f86f" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Reference" id="50e2-0f8d-7451-d1f3" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="3360-1158-e879-9606"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Thorgrim&apos;s Beard! There Are Grudges to Be Settled!" id="4c4e-8d84-3e9a-b039" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If your general was destroyed this turn, you can give up to 3 friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units 1 grudge mark.
Otherwise, pick up to 3 of the following effects:
• If any friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units were destroyed this turn, give 1 grudge mark to a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit.
• If any friendly **^^Kromdron^^** units are contesting an objective that is being contested by any enemy units, give 1 grudge mark to a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit.
• If any friendly **^^Grimmdron^^** units charged this turn, are in combat, have not been destroyed and did not destroy an enemy unit this turn, give 1 grudge mark to a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit.
• If any damage points were allocated to your general this turn, give 1 grudge mark to a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit that is not your general.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Reclaim the Karaks" id="eca0-ee4f-0567-6047" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Immediately after your opponent gains control of an objective within your territory, you can give 1 grudge mark to a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit.
Each time a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit uses the &apos;Retreat&apos; ability, after that ability has been resolved, you must remove 1 grudge mark from that unit (if it has one).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Let It Be Known!" id="2e31-ed33-32fe-6155" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds Hero^^** to use this ability, then pick a visible friendly non-**^^Hero Khazalite Holds^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of that **^^Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until the start of your next turn, the target has 1 additional grudge mark.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Gazul, Remember the Fallen!" id="7cb1-188a-3fcf-6773" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While at least half the models in a **^^Duardin Khazalite Holds^^** unit have been slain, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons.
**Designer&apos;s Note:** *Models that have been slain and returned to the unit do not count as having been slain for the purposes of this ability.*</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="We Honour Valaya!" id="817a-ee17-bcf0-5b1f" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Duardin Khazalite Holds^^** units in combat to be blessed by Valaya. Then, for each unit blessed by Valaya this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be its target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each unit blessed by Valaya this turn. If that unit is **^^Valayan^^**, use a value of 3 instead. Inflict an amount of mortal damage on its target equal to the roll. Then, you can pick 1 of the following:
• Heal (X) the unit blessed by Valaya, where X is equal to the value of the roll.
• Return a number of slain models to the unit blessed by Valaya with a combined Health characteristic of up to the value of the roll.
You cannot use any other **^^Ancestral Vow^^** abilities for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ancestral Vow^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Inghilde, Our Light in the Darkness" id="b00a-6300-1e23-37b6" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 1 friendly non-**^^Hero Khazalite Holds Infantry^^** unit and up to 1 friendly **^^Khazalite Holds Infantry Hero^^** that are wholly within 6&quot; of the same terrain feature and not in combat to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove the targets from the battlefield and set them up again wholly within 6&quot; of a terrain feature and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. If there are 2 targets, you must set them up within 3&quot; of each other.
You cannot use any other **^^Ancestral Vow^^** abilities for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ancestral Vow^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="By Grungni, Stand Firm!" id="436b-d392-63ba-fc0a" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Duardin Khazalite Holds^^** units to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle round, while a target has not used a **^^Charge^^** ability this battle round, subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of melee weapons used for attacks that target that unit.
You cannot use any other **^^Ancestral Vow^^** abilities for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ancestral Vow^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grimnir&apos;s Wrath Will Burn Bright!" id="0142-f4f3-fe72-1c97" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Duardin Khazalite Holds^^** units to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle round:
• Add 1 to wound rolls for the targets&apos; combat attacks.
• If a target has the **^^Infantry^^** and **^^Grimmdron^^** keywords, it has **^^Strike-first^^** if it charged in the same turn.
You cannot use any other **^^Ancestral Vow^^** abilities for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ancestral Vow^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Enlighten Us with Your Wisdom, Grombrindal!" id="b976-01d8-5b6e-a613" hidden="false" publicationId="f98d-040f-7b3e-eaf1" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle round:
• Add 1 to casting rolls and chanting rolls for friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units.
• While they are wholly within 12&quot; of a friendly **^^Khazalite Holds Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**, friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units have **^^Ward (4+)^^** against damage points inflicted by **^^Spell^^** abilities, **^^Prayer^^** abilities and abilities used by **^^Manifestations^^**.
You cannot use any other **^^Ancestral Vow^^** abilities for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ancestral Vow^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
