                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick 1 of this unit&apos;s non-Companion melee weapons to be the runic weapon. This unit can use this ability even if it is in reserve.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the runic weapon for the rest of the battle. Then, pick 1 of the following:
**Strike a Rune:** Roll a dice. On a 3+, also add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the runic weapon for the rest of the battle.
**Repeatedly Strike a Rune:** Roll a dice. On a 5+, also add 1 to the Attacks characteristic and Damage characteristic of the runic weapon for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
