                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit is not a **^^Priest^^**, it has **^^Wizard (1)^^**. If this unit already has **^^Wizard (1)^^**, it has **^^Wizard (2)^^** instead. In addition, enemy **^^Manifestations^^** have **^^Strike-last^^** while they are within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
