                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any damage points were allocated to an enemy unit by attacks made with this unit&apos;s non-Companion weapons this turn and that enemy unit has been destroyed, give this unit a vengeance token, to a maximum of 3. Until the end of the next turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s non-Companion melee weapons for each vengeance token it has.</characteristic>
