              </attributes>
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Run^^** or **^^Charge^^** ability for a **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If that unit is more than 6&quot; from all other friendly units, you can re-roll the dice that determines how far it can move.</characteristic>
