                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **rage dice**. If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, for the rest of the turn:
• Add **X**&quot; to the Range characteristic and **X** to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Companion** ranged weapons, where **X** is equal to your **fury level**.
• This unit&apos;s **Companion** ranged weapons have **Shoot in Combat**.</characteristic>
